<title>SINGAPORE: Indonesia Nov crude selling prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Nov crude selling prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude was reduced to $22.60 in NOvember compared with $23.12 in October, trade sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>Prices of other grades are as follows:</p>
<p>    TYPE		   NOV	     OCT</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  22.73	   23.38</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	22.64	   23.22</p>
<p> Attaka		   23.58	   24.22</p>
<p> Cinta		    21.87	   22.40</p>
<p> Duri		     21.07	   21.54</p>
<p> Handil		   22.34	   22.90</p>
<p> Lalang		   22.54	   23.08</p>
<p> Widuri		   21.80	   22.33</p>
<p> Belida		   23.57	   24.25</p>
<p> Anoa		     23.98	   24.62</p>
<p> Badak		    23.58	   24.22</p>
<p> Bekapai		  23.58	   24.22</p>
<p> Bunyu		    22.30	   22.82</p>
<p> Jatibarang	     21.59	   22.11</p>
<p> Bontang Mix	    22.44	   23.02</p>
<p> Walio		    22.40	   22.92</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
